Date: Thu, 13 Mar 2025 09:09:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 187/241] NVIDIA: SAUCE: gpio-tegra: add is_tegra_hypervisor
 check

Dynamic pinmuxing is not needed on HV+L
Add is_tegra_hypervisor before mapping pinctrl and GPIO

This change is being merged to unblock pcie test transition on K6.8
This change will be reverted once the driver is updated to do this from DT
and this is being tracked in Bug 5506929

Bug 5196824
Bug 5480750

